  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "苦味が　強い　食材。扱いやすい　ハーブの一種。香り高く　トマトとの　相性が　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "쓴맛이 강한 식재료. 다루기 쉬운 허브의 일종. 향이 진해서 토마토와 궁합이 잘 맞는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "苦味強勁的食材。是容易使用的香草之一。氣味芬芳，和番茄非常搭配。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très amer. Cette herbacée très odorante se marie bien avec beaucoup d’aliments, mais plus particulièrement les tomates.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine sehr bittere, doch äußerst vielseitige Zutat. Diese Kräutersorte duftet herrlich und harmoniert besonders gut mit Tomaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una hierba de fuerte sabor amargo y muy aromática. Se puede usar de diversas formas, pero combina especialmente bien con el tomate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto amaro. Erba aromatica facile da usare in cucina, si abbina bene con i Pomodori.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very bitter ingredient that’s quite versatile, as herbs go. It’s fragrant and goes well with tomatoes.",
